	------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	
	 --JSON Encoder and Parser for Lua 5.1
	 --
	 --Copyright 2007 Shaun Brown  (http://www.chipmunkav.com)
	 --All Rights Reserved.
	 
	 --Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person 
